{
    "name": "rex",
    "title": "Rex",
    "description": "Rex: your Rex sessions in Pi Pocket. Pick a session on any of your machines, the way Rex's own picker does, and work in its terminal from your phone or a laptop. Ghostty's own engine (libghostty-vt) draws the screen, so an editor's cursor shapes, its icons, and its clipboard work. It needs Bun, a Rex server, and a runtime folder of its own, ~/.pi-pocket/rex.",
